{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-scubapro-monorail-weight-pockets-for-buoyancy-compensator-devices-bcds-2604-0102","content_id":"d2a6a37e-6846-4556-a624-80cf36660cbf","description":"Product Recall for SCUBAPRO Monorail Weight Pockets for Buoyancy Compensator Devices (BCDs) presenting a serious risk of drowning.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"80bd40c1-0aa4-46a6-a91a-87a49bf7d8e6","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-22T14:27:57+01:00","id":"80bd40c1-0aa4-46a6-a91a-87a49bf7d8e6","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-04-22T14:27:57+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e8ccdd08ecdb5c6f34ae07/2604-0102-product-recall-SCUBAPRO-weight-pockets-for-BCDs.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: SCUBAPRO Monorail Weight Pockets for Buoyancy Compensator Devices (BCDs)</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of drowning as the D-ring handle that is used to unlock the weight pocket from the Buoyancy Compensator Device (BCD) can detach during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Personal protective equipment (PPE) - Protective Personal Aids Replacement Parts/Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>SCUBA PRO</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>November 2025 to February 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>South Africa</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Monorail weight pockets sold as an accessory to attach to scuba diving buoyancy compensator devices. The weight pocket was sold in two sizes, standard and mini, and eight colours, including black, blue, green, orange, pink, teal, white and yellow.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_80bd40c1-0aa4-46a6-a91a-87a49bf7d8e6\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e8ccdd08ecdb5c6f34ae07/2604-0102-product-recall-SCUBAPRO-weight-pockets-for-BCDs.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-products-part-numbers-and-barcodes\">Affected products, part numbers and barcodes</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Part number</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode (EAN)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Army Green</td>\n      <td>21.795.010</td>\n      <td>4048336444934</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Black</td>\n      <td>21.795.100</td>\n      <td>4048336444880</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Blue</td>\n      <td>21.795.200</td>\n      <td>4048336444910</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Turquoise</td>\n      <td>21.795.250</td>\n      <td>4048336444927</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Orange</td>\n      <td>21.795.400</td>\n      <td>4048336444941</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Yellow</td>\n      <td>21.795.500</td>\n      <td>4048336444903</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – White</td>\n      <td>21.795.600</td>\n      <td>4048336444897</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set – Pink</td>\n      <td>21.795.700</td>\n      <td>4048336444958</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Army Green</td>\n      <td>21.796.010</td>\n      <td>4048336445016</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Black</td>\n      <td>21.796.100</td>\n      <td>4048336444965</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Blue</td>\n      <td>21.796.200</td>\n      <td>4048336444996</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Turquoise</td>\n      <td>21.796.250</td>\n      <td>4048336445009</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Orange</td>\n      <td>21.796.400</td>\n      <td>4048336445023</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Yellow</td>\n      <td>21.796.500</td>\n      <td>4048336444989</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – White</td>\n      <td>21.796.600</td>\n      <td>4048336444972</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monorail Pocket Set (mini) – Pink</td>\n      <td>21.796.700</td>\n      <td>4048336445030</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of drowning as the D-ring handle that is used to unlock the weight pocket from the Buoyancy Compensator Device (BCD) can detach during use. If this happens, the user will not be able to remove the weight pocket in an emergency to rise to the surface safely.</p>\n\n<p>The affected products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<p>Affected consumers should stop using the product immediately and contact the dealer they purchased from for a free repair of the D-ring handle.</p>\n\n<p>For further information and to register for a free repair, please visit the Scuba Pro notice here: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://scubapro.johnsonoutdoors.com/us/recalls\">https://scubapro.johnsonoutdoors.com/us/recalls</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Should you require any further assistance, please email Scuba Pro at <a href=\"mailto:mwpockets@scubapro.com\">mwpockets@scubapro.com</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0102</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-22T13:31:51Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-products-part-numbers-and-barcodes","level":3,"text":"Affected products, part numbers and barcodes"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"personal-protective-equipment-ppe","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-04-22","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-04-22T14:31:51+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-scubapro-monorail-weight-pockets-for-buoyancy-compensator-devices-bcds-2604-0102","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-scubapro-monorail-weight-pockets-for-buoyancy-compensator-devices-bcds-2604-0102","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-scubapro-monorail-weight-pockets-for-buoyancy-compensator-devices-bcds-2604-0102","content_id":"d2a6a37e-6846-4556-a624-80cf36660cbf","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-04-22T13:31:51Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: SCUBAPRO Monorail Weight Pockets for Buoyancy Compensator Devices (BCDs) (2604-0102) ","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-scubapro-monorail-weight-pockets-for-buoyancy-compensator-devices